      "content": "hey, im doing a paper for my sociology class on urban renewal and gentrification. can u help me out? i need to know what the main socio-economic indicators are that show a neighborhood is actually being \"revitalized\" or \"improved\" vs just staying the same or getting worse? like what are the signs that a place is on the up and up?",
